## What This Can't See

- Names used from outside the file: the Data API, OData, ODBC/JDBC, PHP, web viewers, plug-ins, `fmp://` URLs from other apps, server schedules that run scripts by name.
- Names stored in records (configuration tables, mapping JSON from an integration). These sites are marked D.
- Window names (Select Window, Close Window, New Window), and layouts chosen by number (`Go to Layout [ by number ]`), which break when layouts are reordered, not renamed.
- Variables are traced without regard to step order: every value a variable is ever given counts.
